{"created": "2024-12-11T10:37:24.664053+00:00", "modified": "2024-12-11T10:37:24.771509+00:00", "id": 14383450, "conceptrecid": "13898001", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14383450", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.13898001", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14383450", "metadata": {"title": "Dynamic Loop Fusion in HLS - FPGA25 artifact", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14383450", "publication_date": "2023-12-11", "description": "<p>Code implementing the ideas ftom the paper \"Dynamic Loop Fusion in High-Level Synthesis\", together with the evaluation. This repo consists of:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data Unit template in <em>lsq/DataUntiDRAM.hpp</em>. The Hazard Safety Check equation is implemented in the <em>checkNoRAW</em>, <em>checkNoWAW</em>, and <em>checkNoWAR </em>functions.</li>\n<li>Address monotonicity analysis, dependency pair prunning, and DU template parameters in <em>lib/DynamicLoopFusionAnalysis.cpp</em>.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>The transformation that inserts our DU and generates loop PEs and AGUs is in&nbsp;<em>lib/DynamicLoopFusionTransform.cpp</em>.</li>\n<li>Evaluation sctipts, benchmarks, and results are in the directory experiments/.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Please see the README.md for build instructions and how to reproduce benchmark results.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Changelog:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>On 11/12/24 removed the&nbsp;<em>gemver </em>benchmark from the evaluation and added author name.</li>\n<li>On 07/10/24 uploaded the initital, anonymous version.</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Szafarczyk, Robert", "affiliation": "University of Glasgow", "orcid": "0009-0007-8883-1747"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 1, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "13898001"}}]}}, "title": "Dynamic Loop Fusion in HLS - FPGA25 artifact", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14383450", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14383450", "preview_htm